# Exclude everything, then re-include the crate itself. An allowlist keeps
# target/ out of the build context. It also guarantees that fixtures/ never
# reaches the image: fixtures/ holds an EICAR test string, which container
# image scanners report as malware.
*

!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src
!migrations

# The migrations directory is a build input, because embed_migrations! reads it
# when the crate compiles. Its prose is not.
migrations/README.md
